# Supabase configuration (optional)
#
# Copy this file to frontend/.env.local and fill in the values from your
# Supabase project settings (Project Settings → API).
#
# Both variables are read by frontend/src/lib/supabaseClient.ts. Values are
# trimmed; the URL must be a valid http(s) URL. Use only a public client key
# (legacy anon JWT or sb_publishable_…), never a service_role/secret key.
#
# When these are absent the app runs local-only: "Save to Cloud" still saves to
# localStorage, but the header shows a warning that Supabase is not configured.
#
# Restart `npm run dev` after changing these values.
VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-or-publishable-key
